# the aphes.ist theme's own assets (Aphesis Script, the φ) are fetched at install time and never committed:
# see themes/aphesis/assets/NOTICE.md
themes/aphesis/assets/*
!themes/aphesis/assets/NOTICE.md
# an empty manifest is committed so the runtime's one probe for fetched assets never 404s;
# scripts/fetch-aphesis-assets.mjs fills it in
!themes/aphesis/assets/fetched.json
node_modules/
